{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1948c7cd39017030","type":"text","text":"The Raven Queen, Matron of Ravens-> Goddess of death, fate, twilight and winter, a neutral God who hates and despises un death and immortality. She is although morally grey on the side of life will do anything to preserve it. She is known for being the only mortal to ever ascend to Godhood and her followers aided in building the most holy city in the world known as Vasselhiem. \n\n\n\n\nThe Raven Queen is the only God on the other side of the Divine Gate because the world needs her power of fate and death in order for there to not be chaos. \n\nThe Raven Queen does not directly influence the world as that would a breach of trust between her and the other Gods. \n\nShe is the only mortal to ever raise to the Power of Godhood and the way that she achieved that feat was lost in time. \n\nShe is the current force keeping all evils from the Material plane limiting the access all other planes have on the world, if any being from out side Villatos wants to make an influence on the world she will know about it, however she cannot intervene directly.\n","x":-1160,"y":-480,"width":759,"height":420},
		{"id":"d1bdeb951a109a84","type":"text","text":"[[Prime Deities.canvas]]\n[[Aralia Lumiere.canvas]]\n[[Vax'Ildan.canvas]]","x":-1220,"y":-680,"width":360,"height":100},
